cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Virtual E. coli K-12: a browser-based whole-cell molecular model"
abstract: >-
  A whole-cell, molecular-scale model of Escherichia coli K-12 MG1655
  explorable in the browser. A Python pipeline turns the UniProt reference
  proteome, measured copy numbers and PDB/AlphaFold structures into
  coarse-grained ingredients; a three.js viewer packs and renders them as a
  slab through a fast-growing cell.
type: software
authors:
